1 REM FBCS GFX-0187
2 REM CLAIM A-12.1.4-TR133
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 13.5.2 l.10532-10533, 12.1.4 l.8805-8807: EXIT PICTURE in the detached handler of an EXTERNAL PICTURE.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
20 DRAW P
30 PRINT "END"
40 END
100 EXTERNAL PICTURE P
110 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
120   CAUSE EXCEPTION 3
130 END WHEN
140 PRINT "NO"
150 HANDLER H
160   PRINT "H"
170   EXIT PICTURE
180 END HANDLER
190 END PICTURE
